                        <h5>Black Wattle specializes in handcrafted leather goods inspired by its namesake tree's rich
                            heritage. Their accessories honor the Black Wattle's historical role in leather
                            tanning, blending timeless design with artisanal craftsmanship. Each
                            piece, from wallets to bags, embodies the rugged elegance of well-crafted leather. They
                            don't just make products; they preserve a legacy, offering their customers a tangible
